Other models
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Silero VAD          -- silero-vad / MIT
Whisper large-v3    -- openai/whisper / MIT (CT2 conversion: deepdml/* / MIT)
Kokoro TTS          -- speaches-ai/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX / Apache-2.0
